      "type": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "content": "### Beat 2 \u2014 Orchestrator (U1\u2013U6)\nSwitch Log rate analysis to data view **Elastic Co. Orchestrator Logs**. Expected terms: `tenant.id: acme-retail`, `log.level: error`, `orchestrator.task_id: charge_payment`.",
        "title": "",
